{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/101236-interested-in-first-tongue-ideas-sumerian-de-grimmed-at-your-disposal","id":101236,"title":"Interested in First Tongue ideas? Sumerian De-Grimmed at your disposal","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-29T06:48:06-07:00","id":101236,"title":"Interested in First Tongue ideas? Sumerian De-Grimmed at your disposal","content":"Hiya folks,<br /> <br /> I have put together a spreadsheet of Sumerian words with their meanings, and applied Grimm's Law in reverse, and applied forwards.<br /> <br /> As anyone who's kept track of First Tongue likely knows, the transformation is the easy bit - it's 'step 3' where the words get further tweaked by the authors into more pleasing forms that cannot be easily automated.<br /> <br /> But at least with this sheet, the mechanical transformations are applied consistently to work from a solid foundation.<br /> <br /> If you're looking for a particular word, the Find function of your web browser *should* work. Otherwise browse to your heart's content - ~6000 entries, currently sorted by Broad Meaning.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/19YdC-2Phr8b2JndCZniCbw9l3SCnhHjcEkfi-rspTyE/edit#gid=0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/19YdC-2Phr8b2JndCZniCbw9l3SCnhHjcEkfi-rspTyE/edit#gid=0\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/19YdC-2Phr8b2JndCZniCbw9l3SCnhHjcEkfi-rspTyE/edit#gid=0\" target=\"_blank\">